<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Brew a drink... for a very particular... refined coffee drinker.-->
  <VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.description>为特殊嗜好人群制作的一种咖啡</VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing cannibal coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.jobString>正在制作人肉咖啡</VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew cannibal coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.label>制作人肉咖啡</VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Brew a drink made with whiskey and coffee blended thoroughly before forming a head and being topped with a spoonful of whipped cream. Perfect for those who just got out of bed and are already wanting to go back to it.-->
  <VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.description>制作一种充分混合了威士忌和咖啡的雪顶爱尔兰咖啡。适合在大冬天早上暖暖身子。</VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing irish coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.jobString>正在制作爱尔兰咖啡</VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew irish coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.label>制作爱尔兰咖啡</VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Brew a potent espresso mixed with fresh milk to help ease bitterness before pouring and serving. Lattes have a reputation of being particularly meant for “sophisticated” individuals.-->
  <VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.description>用一部分特浓咖啡混合鲜奶抹去苦味。拿铁咖啡通常很符合“成熟人士”的人设。</VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing latte coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.jobString>正在制作拿铁咖啡</VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew latte coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.label>制作拿铁咖啡</VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Brew a coffee mixed with sweet and luxurious chocolate. Those of snobbish persuasion would argue mocha is more of a dessert than an actual coffee drink.-->
  <VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.description>制作一种混合了巧克力的摩卡咖啡。自恃高雅之人可能会说摩卡咖啡更接近一种甜点，而不是咖啡。</VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing mocha coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.jobString>正在制作摩卡咖啡</VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew mocha coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.label>制作摩卡咖啡</VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Make a particularly bitter tea cut with creamy milk, wakes one up a bit and relaxes one's mind.-->
  <VBE_MakeBlackTea.description>用发酵茶叶外加一些牛奶泡一份微苦的茶，可以提神醒脑。</VBE_MakeBlackTea.description>
  <!--EN: Making black tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeBlackTea.jobString>正在制作红茶</VBE_MakeBlackTea.jobString>
  <!--EN: make black tea-->
  <VBE_MakeBlackTea.label>制作红茶</VBE_MakeBlackTea.label>
  <!--EN: Make a warm, bitter beverage usually complemented with milk and sugar. A favorite among students and office workers across the galaxy due to high caffeine content and pleasing aroma. Brewing coffee in a espresso machine is generally much faster.-->
  <VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.description>制作一份浓厚味苦的咖啡饮料。几乎全银河的学生和社畜都在饮用咖啡以获取咖啡因。用咖啡机制作咖啡速度更快。</VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.description>
  <!--EN: Making coffee.-->
  <VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.jobString>正在制作咖啡</VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.jobString>
  <!--EN: make espresso coffee-->
  <VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.label>制作特浓咖啡</VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.label>
  <!--EN: Make a sugary tea left out to ferment, after fermenting the end product is a sweet and sour, sometimes even naturally fizzy drink known as kombucha. Praised for health benefits, though some remain skeptical.-->
  <VBE_MakeKombucha.description>将茶叶和糖泡在一起发酵，最后会变成一种又酸又甜还有点气泡的饮料，也就是红茶菌。据说很养生，只是据说啊。</VBE_MakeKombucha.description>
  <!--EN: Making kombucha tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeKombucha.jobString>正在制作红茶菌</VBE_MakeKombucha.jobString>
  <!--EN: make kombucha tea-->
  <VBE_MakeKombucha.label>制作红茶菌</VBE_MakeKombucha.label>
  <!--EN: Make a pleasing, aromatic beverage prepared by steeping a bag of tea leaves in boiling water. Brewing tea in this specially prepared espresso machine is generally much faster.-->
  <VBE_MakeTeaFast.description>将茶叶浸入开水，制作一份茶。用茶制作咖啡速度更快。</VBE_MakeTeaFast.description>
  <!--EN: Making fast tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeTeaFast.jobString>正在制作速冲茶</VBE_MakeTeaFast.jobString>
  <!--EN: make fast tea-->
  <VBE_MakeTeaFast.label>制作速冲茶</VBE_MakeTeaFast.label>
  <!--EN: Make a mixture of coffee and tea. Tea and coffee drinkers respectively set their differences aside while concocting this unholy amalgamation. Whether it’s served hot or cold it’s equally confusing to the imbiber.-->
  <VBE_MakeYuenYeung.description>制作一种混合了咖啡和茶的特色饮品，咖啡爱好者和茶爱好者通常会罕见地联合起来批判这种异端产物。不论冷热，味道都挺奇怪。</VBE_MakeYuenYeung.description>
  <!--EN: Making yuenyeung.-->
  <VBE_MakeYuenYeung.jobString>正在制作鸳鸯</VBE_MakeYuenYeung.jobString>
  <!--EN: make yuenyeung-->
  <VBE_MakeYuenYeung.label>制作鸳鸯</VBE_MakeYuenYeung.label>
  <!--EN: This espresso machine has a small built-in grill to reheat iced coffee.-->
  <VBE_ReheatCoffee.description>用咖啡机内置的加热元件重新加热冰咖啡。</VBE_ReheatCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Reheating iced coffee.-->
  <VBE_ReheatCoffee.jobString>正在加热冰咖啡</VBE_ReheatCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: reheat iced coffee-->
  <VBE_ReheatCoffee.label>加热冰咖啡</VBE_ReheatCoffee.label>
</LanguageData>
